        "body": "<link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"https://web.premierleague.pulselive.com/resources/rebrand/v7.153.79/styles/app-article.css\">\n\n<script src=\"https://web.premierleague.pulselive.com/resources/rebrand/v7.153.79/app/app-external.js\"></script>\n\n<script type=\"text/javascript\">\n    window.RESOURCE_VERSION_REBRAND = 'rebrand/v7.153.79';\n\twindow.RESOURCE_VERSION = 'rebrand/v7.153.79';\n\twindow.BASE_RESOURCE_URL = 'https://web.premierleague.pulselive.com/resources';\n\twindow.FAST_MOVING_DATA_ENABLED = 'false';\n\twindow.SPONSOR_LOGOS_TO_HIDE = 'castrol';\n\twindow.PL_COMPSEASON_ID = '777';\n</script>\n\n<div class=\"wrapper col-12\">\n\t<div class=\"standardArticle js-article__content\">\n\t    <p>The match officials for Matchweek 27 of the 2025/26 Premier League season, spanning Saturday 21, Sunday 22 and Monday 23 February, have been appointed.</p><div class=\"articleWidget full-width\">\n<div\n    data-d2c\n    class=\"embeddable-match-card\"\n    data-widget=\"match-card/embeddable-match-card\"\n    data-match-reference=\"2562155\"\n    data-title=\"\"\n>\n</div>\n</div><p><strong>Referee</strong>: Michael Oliver. <strong>Assistants</strong>: Stuart Burt, James Mainwaring. <strong>Fourth official</strong>: Andrew Kitchen. <strong>VAR</strong>: Tony Harrington. <strong>Assistant VAR</strong>: Blake Antrobus.</p><div class=\"articleWidget full-width\">\n<div\n    data-d2c\n    class=\"embeddable-match-card\"\n    data-widget=\"match-card/embeddable-match-card\"\n    data-match-reference=\"2562156\"\n    data-title=\"\"\n>\n</div>\n</div><p><strong>Referee</strong>: Jarred Gillett. <strong>Assistants</strong>: Steve Meredith, Richard West. <strong>Fourth official</strong>: Paul Tierney. <strong>VAR</strong>: Nick Hopton. <strong>Assistant VAR</strong>: Stuart Attwell.</p><div class=\"articleWidget full-width\">\n<div\n    data-d2c\n    class=\"embeddable-match-card\"\n    data-widget=\"match-card/embeddable-match-card\"\n    data-match-reference=\"2562157\"\n    data-title=\"\"\n>\n</div>\n</div><p><strong>Referee</strong>: Lewis Smith. <strong>Assistants</strong>: Adrian Holmes, Simon Long. <strong>Fourth official</strong>: Anthony Taylor. <strong>VAR</strong>: Michael Salisbury. <strong>Assistant VAR</strong>: Marc Perry.</p><div class=\"articleWidget full-width\">\n<div\n    data-d2c\n    class=\"embeddable-match-card\"\n    data-widget=\"match-card/embeddable-match-card\"\n    data-match-reference=\"2562164\"\n    data-title=\"\"\n>\n</div>\n</div><p><strong>Referee</strong>: Sam Barrott. <strong>Assistants</strong>: Tim Wood, Wade Smith. <strong>Fourth official</strong>: Darren England. <strong>VAR</strong>: John Brooks. <strong>Assistant VAR</strong>: Akil Howson.</p><div class=\"articleWidget full-width\">\n<div\n    data-d2c\n    class=\"embeddable-match-card\"\n    data-widget=\"match-card/embeddable-match-card\"\n    data-match-reference=\"2562160\"\n    data-title=\"\"\n>\n</div>\n</div><p><strong>Referee</strong>: Tom Bramall. <strong>Assistants</strong>: Ian Hussin, Constantine Hatzidakis. <strong>Fourth official</strong>: Tim Robinson. <strong>VAR</strong>: James Bell. <strong>Assistant VAR</strong>: Dan Robathan.</p><div class=\"articleWidget full-width\">\n<div\n    data-d2c\n    class=\"embeddable-match-card\"\n    data-widget=\"match-card/embeddable-match-card\"\n    data-match-reference=\"2562158\"\n    data-title=\"\"\n>\n</div>\n</div><p><strong>Referee</strong>: Tom Kirk. <strong>Assistants</strong>: Simon Bennett, Neil Davies. <strong>Fourth official</strong>: Ben Toner. <strong>VAR</strong>: Stuart Attwell. <strong>Assistant VAR</strong>: Steve Meredith.</p><div class=\"articleWidget full-width\">\n<div\n    data-d2c\n    class=\"embeddable-match-card\"\n    data-widget=\"match-card/embeddable-match-card\"\n    data-match-reference=\"2562161\"\n    data-title=\"\"\n>\n</div>\n</div><p><strong>Referee</strong>: Anthony Taylor. <strong>Assistants</strong>: Gary Beswick, Adam Nunn. <strong>Fourth official</strong>: Dean Whitestone. <strong>VAR</strong>: Paul Tierney. <strong>Assistant VAR</strong>: Adrian Holmes.</p><div class=\"articleWidget full-width\">\n<div\n    data-d2c\n    class=\"embeddable-match-card\"\n    data-widget=\"match-card/embeddable-match-card\"\n    data-match-reference=\"2562162\"\n    data-title=\"\"\n>\n</div>\n</div><p><strong>Referee</strong>: Craig Pawson. <strong>Assistants</strong>: Lee Betts, Mat Wilkes. <strong>Fourth official</strong>: Ruebyn Ricardo. <strong>VAR</strong>: Tony Harrington. <strong>Assistant VAR</strong>: Wade Smith.</p><div class=\"articleWidget full-width\">\n<div\n    data-d2c\n    class=\"embeddable-match-card\"\n    data-widget=\"match-card/embeddable-match-card\"\n    data-match-reference=\"2562163\"\n    data-title=\"\"\n>\n</div>\n</div><p><strong>Referee</strong>: Peter Bankes (pictured). <strong>Assistants</strong>: Eddie Smart, Blake Antrobus. <strong>Fourth official</strong>: Sam Barrott. <strong>VAR</strong>: Darren England. <strong>Assistant VAR</strong>: Tim Wood.</p><div class=\"articleWidget full-width\">\n<div\n    data-d2c\n    class=\"embeddable-match-card\"\n    data-widget=\"match-card/embeddable-match-card\"\n    data-match-reference=\"2562159\"\n    data-title=\"\"\n>\n</div>\n</div><p><strong>Referee</strong>: Darren England. <strong>Assistants</strong>: Scott Ledger, Akil Howson. <strong>Fourth official</strong>: Adam Herczeg. <strong>VAR</strong>: Paul Howard. <strong>Assistant VAR</strong>: Sian Massey-Ellis.</p>\n    \n        <div class=\"u-hide\" data-script=\"pl_article-table\" data-widget=\"article-table\"></div>\n\t</div>\n</div>\n\n<script src=\"https://web.premierleague.pulselive.com/resources/rebrand/v7.153.79/app/app-pulse.js\"></script>\n<script src=\"https://web.premierleague.pulselive.com/resources/rebrand/v7.153.79/app/app-widgets.js\"></script>\n<script crossorigin src=\"https://web.premierleague.pulselive.com/resources/rebrand/v7.153.79/scripts/react.bundle.js\" defer></script>",
